    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95787" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπάσ-μα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sprain</i> or <i>rupture of muscular fibre</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				5.25
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				87e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.198
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.9.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				1.239
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>spasm, convulsion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				885a6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>that which has been torn off, fragment, shred</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sull.</u>
				21
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς φρονήσεως μόρια καὶ
			ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.99c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ξίφους</span>
			<i>sword-blade</i>, as <i>drawn from the scabbard</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Oth.</u>
				17
			</span></i>.</div>
